\description{
Parameters controlling the Palantir trajectory inference. The
kNN graph you hand to \code{\link[=run_palantir_sc]{run_palantir_sc()}} feeds the diffusion
kernel. The geodesics are measured over a second kNN graph that Palantir
builds internally on the multiscale space, and \code{knn} is what controls that
one. It is a different knob from \code{k} in the kNN parameter block, which sizes
the backend index. Palantir overrides \code{k} and \code{ann_dist} for its internal
search, so only \code{knn_method} and the backend tuning parameters have an
effect.
}
\references{
Setty, et al., Nat. Biotechnol., 2019.
